<title>UK: Gulf has 5.56 pct of Clyde.</title>
<headline>Gulf has 5.56 pct of Clyde.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil services company Clyde Petroleum Plc said on Thursday Gulf Canada Resources Ltd now holds 5.56 percent of Clyde's issued share capital.</p>
<p>Gulf Canada, a Canadian oil group, has launched a hostile takeover bid for Clyde.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Gulf, which is offering 120p per share to Clyde shareholders, extended its bid until February 18.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
